          "text": "top of page\n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\nOdd Colony Brewing Co is a farmhouse inspired brewery with a heavy focus on seasonality. We believe this philosophy transcends beer as we ebb and flow through all mediums. Our approach to beer is lead by this ethos, but also contains ample beverage fitting to our notoriously hot climate as we have a heavy focus on lagerbier, saison, and ipa.want to host a unique and intimate event at odd colony? please fill out the inquiry below to get a quote:Previous01IMG_8356_Original.jpg02OddColonyBreweryWeddingShoot-40.jpg03IMG_8496_Original.jpg04IMG_2330.JPGNext01IMG_8356_Original.jpg02OddColonyBreweryWeddingShoot-40.jpg03IMG_8496_Original.jpg04IMG_2330.JPGPrevious01IMG_8855_Original.jpg02IMG_2974_Original.jpg03IMG_8856_Original.jpg04IMG_0706.jpgNext01IMG_8855_Original.jpg02IMG_2974_Original.jpg03IMG_8856_Original.jpg04IMG_0706.jpgFirst & Last Name*Email*Phone*Type of Event*Event Date*MonthDayYearEvent Start Time*Time:HoursMinutesAMEvent End Time*Time:HoursMinutesAMExpected # of Guests*Any other necessary infosubmitBE SURE TO CHECK OUT OUR SECOND LOCATION!Visual highlights from our projectsPrevious010203040506Next010203040506THE BURROW IS A BIERGARTEN & TAPROOM BY ODD COLONY BREWING CO. THIS UNIQUE SPACE IS LOCATED IN THE HISTORIC SACRED HEART BUILDING IN THE BEAUTIFUL EAST HILL NEIGHBORHOOD. THE BURROW  |  1010 N 12TH AVE SUITE 111HERE YOU'LL FIND ALL OF YOUR FAVORITE ODD COLONY BEER, SIGNATURE COCKTAILS, DELICIOUS FOOD, A BEAUTIFUL BIERGARTEN\n& UNDERGROUND VIBES.Contact usFirst name*Last nameEmail*Write a messageSubmitPrivacy Policy Accessibility StatementOdd Colony Brewing Co | 260 N Palafox | Pensacola, FL 32502                                                                              hello@oddcolony.com  bottom of page",
